78218521890310_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ydOXOc6Ob6sQ7kNvwGdCupH&_nc_oc=Adpxtd46K9wN6T-cskcwZd0F2ZPnOlq4sqq2WPs_KFjGd3KHMKiACmS-3jN1wexHDVY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSs0NSLXgBN06LcvkwvNxo9mIh3FrvmkGpSZSba8niHVg&oe=6B0867E5"}, "display_name": "Healium", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Beautiful, nature-based escapes powered by your imagination. Float through a crystal forest, feel a healing rain wash over you, or sit quietly in a field of sunflowers. Virtually travel to Mauii, listen to the rustle of a bamboo forest and the ocean waves lapping at your feet. Experience different colors of healing, trace a mandalynth, or glide through a breath-taking fractal. Use your feelings of focused calm to make the flurries fly inside a magic snow globe. Sit quietly inside a zen garden. Grow leaves on a 150-year-old Burr Oak tree with your memories of being still. Healium is a walk in the park for those times when you can't physically take a walk in the park. In four peer-reviewed journals, Healium has been shown to improve mood in as little as four minutes. Connect an optional EEG meditation headband to make a firefly rise and fall with your feelings. Healium is a reminder that our thoughts have power to control things not only in the virtual world but the real world as well.", "short_description": "Beautiful, nature-based escapes powered by your imagination.  Float through a crystal forest, feel a healing rain wash over you, or sit quietly in a field of sunflowers. Virtually travel to Mauii, listen to the rustle of a bamboo forest and the ocean waves lapping at your feet. Experience different colors of healing, trace a mandalynth, or glide through a breath-taking fractal. Healium is a walk in the park for those times when you can't physically take a walk in the park. "}]}, "developer_name": "Healium", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.tryhealium.com/privacy-policy/", "devel